codex
The initial construction verifies at all four presets. At shipping size it renders a 509-vertex native graph in about 70 KB, keeps the answer at 24 vertices, and the compact recovery currently takes 152 modular operations—comfortably within the 300-operation cap. I’m now stress-testing density, attacks, canonicalization, and the polynomial reference scan.
