The first adversary sweep exposed a real weakness: a naive ordinary-gap heuristic solved 2 of 8 shipping instances. I removed that version rather than masking the result; the panel now uses a stricter no-tool label-order ansatz, while the successful modular affine scan remains disclosed separately as Track B’s reference algorithm. The degree and greedy attacks are 0/8 so far.
