+        "vertex labels and use the affine symmetry it exposes; without that "
+        "pattern one must solve a large constrained separating-code search."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: the successful exhaustive affine-template algorithm is "
+        "O(n^2 k) before exact code checks and solved 8/8 shipping instances "
+        "using 17,278,488 modular image operations in 18.70 seconds in the "
+        "recorded self-test; the compact difference-multiplicity route used "
+        "at most 250 exact modular operations once the symmetry was seen."
+    ),
