The source confirms the directional condition exactly as implemented, and it also confirms that the paper numbers the supporting random-graph result as Lemma 3 (the draft notes had called it Lemma 1). I’ve corrected that citation. All local gates now pass with the stronger baseline: the CSP solver succeeds 8/8, using an estimated 17.15 billion 64-bit word operations over 48.87 seconds total; the compact invariant route stays at 250 scalar modular operations.
